solution.p:
\begin{gathered}
{6-6G-6}\gt{12-6}\\
{-6G}\gt{6}\\
{\frac{-6G}{-6}}\lt{-{\frac{6}{6}}}\\
G\lt-1
\end{gathered}
So in set-builder notation, the solution set is {\{ G \mid G \lt  -1 \}}\text{.}

